Original,Strategy,Behavioral,Rate Limiter Backend Selection,"Strategy=ApiWeb.RateLimiter.Limiter; ConcreteStrategy=ApiWeb.RateLimiter.ETS; ConcreteStrategy=ApiWeb.RateLimiter.Memcache; Context=ApiWeb.RateLimiter","apps/api_web/lib/api_web/rate_limiter/limiter.ex:1-20; apps/api_web/lib/api_web/rate_limiter/ets.ex:1-34; apps/api_web/lib/api_web/rate_limiter/memcache.ex:1-31; apps/api_web/lib/api_web/rate_limiter.ex:1-60","The common behaviour defines backend callbacks. ETS and Memcache implement the behaviour. ApiWeb.RateLimiter obtains the configured backend and delegates start_link/1 and rate_limited?/2. The inspected configuration selects ETS."
Original,Strategy,Behavioral,State Data Parsing,"Strategy=Parse; Shared parser support=Parse.Simple; ConcreteStrategy=Parse.Alerts; ConcreteStrategy=Parse.Line; ConcreteStrategy=Parse.Routes; Context=State.Server","apps/parse/lib/parse.ex:1-9; apps/parse/lib/parse/simple.ex:19-29; apps/parse/lib/parse/alerts.ex:16-23; apps/parse/lib/parse/line.ex:1-36; apps/parse/lib/parse/routes.ex:1-45; apps/state/lib/state/server.ex:30-32,169-172,263-272,611-614; apps/state/lib/state/alert.ex:7-11; apps/state/lib/state/line.ex:7-12","Parse defines a common parse(binary) callback. Alerts, Line and Routes provide different parsing implementations; State.Server uses the configured parser to process incoming binary data. Parse.Simple provides shared CSV parsing support for parsers that use it."

